{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDYFujf8dH6UrtdEcbJj", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：美国专利 US 3,600,186**，名称是 \"Low calorie fat-containing food compositions\"，内容就是后来奥利斯特拉（olestra）所用的蔗糖聚酯。\n\n依据：我搜了 1 次，打开的几份后来的专利都引用了 3,600,186，写明发明人是 Mattson 和 Volpenhein，内容是用至少带 4 个脂肪酸酯基的糖或糖醇脂肪酸酯，替代食品中约 10%–100% 的脂肪。欧洲专利 EP0375239 写明这件专利 1971 年 8 月 17 日授权。\n\n没核实的部分：搜到的资料里没有写 1968 年的申请日期，我也没看到专利原文。专利号本身有几份资料互相印证。\n\n来源：\n- [US4983413A – Google Patents](https://patents.google.com/patent/US4983413)\n- [US5612080A – Google Patents](https://patents.google.com/patent/US5612080)\n- [EP0375239 – EPO](https://data.epo.org/publication-server/rest/v1.2/patents/EP0375239NWB1/document.pdf)\n- [US4508746A – Google Patents](https://patents.google.com/patent/US4508746)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1510, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4300, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1510}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:07:00.429Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDYFuS49hvKsmEpxieMu"}
